# The data pipeline and backend API that produce apps/web-risk-viewer/public/
# data/ live in a separate private repo (45-45-platform, sibling checkout) -
# nothing to gitignore for them here anymore, they're just not part of this
# repo's tree at all. See 45-45-platform's README for how the two connect.

.env
.env.*
*.log

